json: HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ncontent-type: application/json\r\ndate: <date>\r\ncontent-length: 7\r\n\r\n{"a":1}
own content type: HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ncontent-type: text/html; charset=utf-8\r\ndate: <date>\r\ncontent-length: 9\r\n\r\n<p>hi</p>
204: HTTP/1.1 204 No Content\r\ndate: <date>\r\n\r\n
304: HTTP/1.1 304 Not Modified\r\ndate: <date>\r\n\r\n
not found: HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found\r\ndate: <date>\r\ncontent-length: 0\r\n\r\n
