the handler saw HEAD, stream function called: False
-- request bodies
echo: HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ncontent-type: application/octet-stream\r\ndate: <date>\r\ncontent-length: 5\r\n\r\nhello
chunked echo: HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ncontent-type: application/octet-stream\r\ndate: <date>\r\ncontent-length: 5\r\n\r\nhello
