echoed: wrote it all, read True bytes past the body
responded first: wrote it all, read HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ncontent-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\r\ndate: <date>\r\ncontent-length: 7\r\nconnection: close\r\n\r\nignored
