-- time limits
slowloris: the server closed the connection, in time: True
event: a connection failed: read: timed out
stall: read True short of the body
event: a response was cut short: write: timed out
quiet stream: HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ncontent-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\r\ndate: <date>\r\ntransfer-encoding: chunked\r\n\r\n5\r\ntick,\r\n4\r\ntock\r\n0\r\n\r\n
events: 0
own stall limit: read True past the body
idle: responded True, then closed in time: True
events: 0
cap: first True, second waited True and got a response True
